  ('e8f7c92b-8a1e-4c3d-b5e2-0a1b2c3d4e5f', 'ebb', '/eb/', 'v.', 'Suy thoái dần, rút dần, tàn lụi', 'As wartime fervor began to ebb across the republic, citizen assemblies voiced escalating dissatisfaction with heavy taxation and trade restrictions.', 'Lesson 10', 10, 92),
